Description: metapackage installing the full Runix stack
 One-step install of the Runix system-administration stack: the rctl
 command-line interface, the pkgstate and rsystemd subsystems, and the
 privileged audit broker. Installs no files of its own; it only pulls in the
 stack.
 .
 Experimental. Part of Runix (https://github.com/cornball-ai/runix).
